matches: "AGENT_FLOW.md:21:11. `<mermaid>` - call `validate_mermaid` before a mermaid fence. Omitted when the agent has no `validate_mermaid` tool.\nexample/system-prompt.md:93:Before a `mermaid` fence goes in the reply, call `validate_mermaid` with that exact source.\nexample/tool-stats/validate_mermaid/README.md:1:# validate_mermaid\nexample/tool-stats/validate_mermaid/README.md:45:- `validate_mermaid: <serde error>`: argument shape did not match the schema.\nexample/tool-stats/validate_mermaid/README.md:46:- `validate_mermaid: source is empty.`: source was blank after trim, or the fence had no body.\nexample/tool-stats/validate_mermaid/README.md:47:- `validate_mermaid: source exceeds 100000 chars.`: source too long.\nexample/tool-stats/validate_mermaid/README.md:48:- `validate_mermaid: node is not available.`: the `node` binary did not start.\nexample/tool-stats/validate_mermaid/README.md:49:- `validate_mermaid: mermaid package was not found.`: `node_modules/mermaid` was not next to the repo or the executable.\nexample/tool-stats/validate_mermaid/README.md:50:- `validate_mermaid: parser exited without a result.`: node exited before writing a parse result.\nexample/tool-stats/validate_mermaid/README.md:51:- `validate_mermaid: parser task failed`: the background parse task did not finish.\nexample/tool-stats/validate_mermaid/README.md:52:- `validate_mermaid: could not write the diagram.`: the parser process had no stdin.\nexample/tool-stats/validate_mermaid/README.md:61:`src-tauri/src/tools/validate_mermaid.rs` - entry point: `spec()` / `execute_async()`.\nexample/tool-stats/validate_mermaid/stats.md:1:# validate_mermaid"